00:03:45.760 --> 00:03:47.830
variables as well. I suggest you don't

00:03:47.840 --> 00:03:49.990
use variables at this beginner level

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:51.830
because their behavior is a bit more

00:03:51.840 --> 00:03:53.990
